<item><title>Madagascar anti-corruption prosecutor seeks warrants for Rajoelina and Ntsay</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-anti-corruption-prosecutor-seeks-warrants-for-f512d5/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-anti-corruption-prosecutor-seeks-warrants-for-f512d5/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The requests follow charges against 13 people over five aircraft registered in Madagascar and transferred to Iran.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 06:55:25 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-anti-corruption-prosecutor-seeks-warrants-for-f512d5/share.jpg" length="43571" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-anti-corruption-prosecutor-seeks-warrants-for-f512d5/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Germany commits €56.5 million to Madagascar projects</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/germany-commits-56-5-million-to-madagascar-projects-61a910/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/germany-commits-56-5-million-to-madagascar-projects-61a910/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The funding, agreed after talks in Antananarivo, includes €46.4 million for financial cooperation and €10.1 million for technical assistance.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 06:55:04 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Madagascar’s football federation gives Ajesaia kit and balls</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-football-federation-gives-ajesaia-kit-and-balls-a10865/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/madagascar-s-football-federation-gives-ajesaia-kit-and-balls-a10865/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The club’s U15 side won its category and its U13 team finished second at a junior tournament in Mauritius on 14-15 November.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 04:43:30 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Ajesaia wins three trophies at Mauritius youth tournament</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/ajesaia-wins-three-trophies-at-mauritius-youth-tournament-0e2115/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/mg/ajesaia-wins-three-trophies-at-mauritius-youth-tournament-0e2115/</guid><category>Madagascar</category><description>The Madagascar club’s under-13s took the title, while its under-15s finished second in the competition held on 14 and 15 November.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 03:00:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" length="36472" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/mg.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
